    "description": "Title for in-app notification disclosure before system permission"
  },
  "notificationPermissionDisclosureBody": "Shayel Driver sends notifications about trips, schedules, and important updates. To deliver them, the app uses push notifications and a device token stored on our servers. Tap Continue to open the system permission request.",
